# Build after changes

Do not rebuild VST3 or AU after finishing work. The user rebuilds those manually.

Build Standalone only when Cursor needs that app to confirm its own work or tests. Use the CMake Standalone target for this project (`OpenRbPcf_Standalone`), not a full multi-format build.

```sh
cmake --build build --config Release --target OpenRbPcf_Standalone
```

Do not run `./scripts/build.sh` or a bare `cmake --build build` unless the user asks for a complete/delivery build of every format.
